\name{LL3GAMLSS-package}
\alias{LL3GAMLSS}
\alias{LL3GAMLSS-package}
\title{Three-Parameter Log-Logistic Distributional Regression}
\description{
Support-safe three-parameter shifted log-logistic distributional regression
for classic \pkg{gamlss}, including diagnostics, uncertainty helpers, and a
calendar-month LL3-SPEI workflow.
}
\details{
The validated nonstationary scope estimates a constant threshold and permits
covariates in the scale and shape predictors. Fits whose threshold contacts
the numerical support boundary are not considered suitable for ordinary
likelihood inference.
}
